{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE23dialogSuppressionToggle12isSuppressedQrAA7BindingVySbG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dialogSuppressionToggle"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isSuppressed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"title":"dialogSuppressionToggle(isSuppressed:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dialogSuppressionToggle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSuppressed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the suppression toggle is on or off"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the dialog."}]}],"name":"isSuppressed"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Applying dialog suppression adds a toggle to dialogs on Windows,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which allows the user to request the alert not be displayed again.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Typically whether a dialog is suppressed is stored in ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and used to decide whether to present the dialog in the future.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example configures an alert with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"suppression toggle. The toggle’s state is stored in ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“Delete Items” button is pressed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var isShowingDialog = false","    @AppStorage(\"suppressEraseItemAlert\")","    private var suppressAlert = false","","    var body: some Scene {","        Window(...) {","            Button(\"Delete items\") {","                isShowingDialog = true","            }","        }","","        AlertScene(","            \"Are you sure you want to erase these items?\",","            isPresented: $isShowingDialog","        ) {","            Button(\"Erase\", role: .destructive) {","                \/\/ Handle item deletion.","            }","            Button(\"Cancel\", role: .cancel) {","                \/\/ Handle cancellation","            }","        }","        .dialogSuppressionToggle(","            \"Do not ask about erasing items again\",","            isSuppressed: $suppressAlert)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(issuppressed:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Enables user suppression of an alert with a custom suppression","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/dialogSuppressionToggle(isSuppressed:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A value with a modifier applied to it."}],"title":"ModifiedContent","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModifiedContent"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent/dialogSuppressionToggle(isSuppressed:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(issuppressed:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/dialogSuppressionToggle(isSuppressed:)","title":"dialogSuppressionToggle(isSuppressed:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables user suppression of an alert with a custom suppression"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mess